==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~26.67 seconds<sup>200f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 12~48 seconds<sup>360f~1,440f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~80 seconds<sup>600f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 25.33~101.33 seconds<sup>760f~3,040f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]]. When they die, keep replacing them. Meanwhile, upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to max level. When Gory appears, spawn meatshields, [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cats]]. After you kill the Gory, start focusing on sending out [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cats]] and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] along with meatshields. Sir Seal should die easily.

