==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Gifu Prefecture'''.
*Gifu Prefecture's base looks like it would belong to the [[wikipedia:Historic Villages of Shirakawa-gō and Gokayama|Historic Villages of Shirakawa-gō and Gokayama]], a World Heritage Site that spans from Gifu to Toyama Prefectures.

